  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b5a08e4ab530b9c4fa63ef5a5c611cbe, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Great job!
  - This was pretty simple, but a real enemy is going to fight back, so you'll want
    to dodge its attacks.
  - Enemies will be passive towards you at first, but if you make a sound in the
    area they patrol they'll go to investigate it and start chasing you.
  - So you might want to sneak in their patrol area to avoid alerting them.
  - '(Mechanic unlocked: hold control while moving to sneak)'
  unlockedMechanics:
  - Sneaking
